t;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;前連結会計年度（自　&lt;span&gt;2022年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:49pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:49pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:49pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度（自　&lt;span&gt;2023年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:405pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（単位：千円）&lt;/p&gt;
